msgctxt "BasicGroup"
msgid "Shadows"
msgstr ""

#: crates/leyline-studio/ui/panels/develop_basic.slint:168
msgctxt "BasicGroup"
msgid ""
"Lifts or lowers the dark tones above the black point. Blacks sets the point "
"itself."
