msgctxt "BasicGroup"
msgid "Vibrance"
msgstr ""

#: crates/leyline-studio/ui/panels/develop_basic.slint:250
msgctxt "BasicGroup"
msgid ""
"Saturates the muted colours and spares the vivid ones. Saturation moves them "
"all equally."
